  "body": "SchemaCrawler  release at last commit 6046460e37a71fdcdd7ca88aa563b4bd9be62a25\nSee the change history at https://www.schemacrawler.com/changes-report.html\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump chainguard-dev/actions/setup-gitsign from 1.6.35 to 1.6.36 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2503\n* Bump github/codeql-action from 4.38.0 to 4.38.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2502\n* Fixes #2501 - do not fail on badly formatted YAML files for lightweight database connectors by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2504\n* Report betweenness as a percentage by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2505\n* v17.15.5 by @sualeh in https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/pull/2506\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schemacrawler/SchemaCrawler/compare/v17.15.4...v17.15.5",
